Web Services, Inc.: オンデマンドインスタンスの料金 - Amazon EC2 (仮想サーバー) | AWS","id":1,"title":"オンデマンドインスタンスの料金 - Amazon EC2 (仮想サーバー) | AWS","title_link":"https://aws.amazon.com/jp/ec2/pricing/on-demand/","text":"オンデマンドインスタンスについては、お客様が使用された EC2 インスタンスの料金のみのお支払いとなります。オンデマンドインスタンスを使用することにより、ハードウェアのプランニング、購入、維持に伴うコストや手間が省け、高額な固定費となりがちな運用コストを、より低額な変動費に抑えられます。","thumb_url":"https://a0.awsstatic.com/libra-css/images/logos/aws_logo_smile_179x109.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Amazon Web Services, Inc.","service_icon":"https://a0.awsstatic.com/libra-css/images/site/touch-icon-iphone-114-smile.png","thumb_width":179,"thumb_height":109,"from_url":"https://aws.amazon.com/jp/ec2/pricing/on-demand/","original_url":"https://aws.amazon.com/jp/ec2/pricing/on-demand/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p8XN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5125fa61-1cc8-4506-92a2-c88e945ae5a3","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"遅そう…","ts":"1624344266.052000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IVIx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3fb744a-7803-4b77-a152-8720c008c98e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。いつもEBSを使ってるのでそっちかなと思ってます。\nS3のバージョンはS3をそのままマウントできるのでしょうか？(EBSよりS3の方が安いですよね？そっちがいいのかな。)","ts":"1624344255.051800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4fMV3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5fca5bb-ae4f-45a2-9b42-99b4c189878f","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"s3 はご存知 s3 のことだと思うけど","ts":"1624344221.051600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pIH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4f2cf44a-a93b-4ab9-adc6-66ad0bde1e36","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://aws.amazon.com/jp/ebs/\u003e","ts":"1624344210.051200","attachments":[{"fallback":"Ama